      "title": "Prepare-merge — get a feature branch ready to land",
      "description": "Take a feature branch to a clean, conflict-free, green, pushed state so it can be merged with no surprises: base merged in, generated files regenerated, the folio's content-type gates run, then pushed. It does NOT merge and does NOT push to the default branch. Use for \"prepare-merge\", \"make it mergeable\", \"ship it\".",
